An item's attribute block moves its content column; its checkbox does not

```
-{#k} [x] a
      # h
.
<ul>
  <li id="k"><input type="checkbox" checked disabled aria-label="a"> a
    <h1 id="h">h</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
-{#k} [x] a
  # h
.
<ul>
  <li id="k"><input type="checkbox" checked disabled aria-label="a # h"> a
# h</li>
</ul>
```

